      <div class="about-story">
        <p>When we started {{ site.name }} back in {{ site.founded }}, the goal was simple: show up on time, charge a fair price, and treat every customer's home like our own. More than fifteen years later, that hasn't changed — and neither has our phone number.</p>
        <p>We've grown into one of {{ site.areaServed }}'s most trusted garage door teams, but we're still locally owned and operated. When you call, you'll talk to a real person who knows your neighborhood. When we arrive, it's a trained technician — not a subcontractor we just met.</p>
        <p>Florida's heat, humidity, and hurricane season are hard on garage doors. We stock corrosion-resistant parts and install wind-rated doors built for our climate, so your repair lasts — not just through the warranty period, but for years beyond it.</p>
      </div>
